            "media_scale": 100,
            "heading": "Submit The Contact Form Below",
            "text": "<p>The first step in obtaining your insurance-covered breast pump is to fill out our contact form. This form is simple and quick to complete and helps us gather your basic information to start the process. By providing your contact details, we can understand your needs and determine how best to support you. Once submitted, our team will begin reviewing your details to help expedite your order.</p>",
