          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "enable_media": false,
            "media_scale": 100,
            "heading": "Supply Additional Patient Insurance Information",
            "text": "<p>Once we receive your contact form, we may need some additional patient information to proceed with your insurance verification. Our team will handle all insurance-related paperwork once you provide everything we need. This may include your insurance policy details, prescription information if required, and any other relevant personal details. Rest assured, our process is secure, and we take privacy seriously. Providing accurate and complete information ensures that we can verify your eligibility smoothly and without delays.<br/></p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "template--21965917618491__70b6796a-4aa7-4791-9ea6-72e90afed64c-column-3": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "enable_media": false,
            "media_scale": 100,
            "heading": "Our Providers Will Contact You!",
            "text": "<p>After receiving and reviewing all necessary information, one of our dedicated providers will reach out to you directly. During this contact, we’ll discuss your options, confirm your insurance eligibility, and help you choose the best breast pump for your needs. Our providers will be there to answer any questions and guide you through the final steps to ensure you get your breast pump quickly and without hassle. We are committed to making this process as seamless as possible, so you can focus on what matters most—caring for your baby.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        }
