          }
        },
        "text_pt9KDz": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Selecting the right breast pump can feel overwhelming, especially for first-time mothers. It’s important to consider factors such as how often you’ll be using the pump, its portability, and your comfort. Hands-free breast pumps are a fantastic option for busy moms who need to pump while multitasking or have limited time. These pumps allow you to express milk without using your hands, providing complete mobility. Additionally, many insurance plans cover the cost of breast pumps, making it easier to obtain a high-quality device with minimal out-of-pocket expenses. Explore the kinds of breast pumps offered by Ameda below. </p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
